Subject: [PATCH] test(kanban): pin spend-decision routing, open-run hold
 guard, wake and TUI notice kinds [daveey]

Runtime-15 audit t_a381eb4e537b77d0 found five exact changed-line mutants of #3123
(6369c6fb7a) that survived its own suite and a widened 14-file corpus. Test-only;
production semantics unchanged. New file tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_spend_decision_routing.py:

- headless (local-<64hex>) chat link is not bound; a supervisor card decides (M09)
- link binding platform: own gateway + active profile -> tui/<session>; own gateway
  other profile and remote gateway -> hub/<gw>/<profile>/<session> (M11)
- pending hold leaves a ready/review card with an open run (expired claim) untouched,
  and takes it to triage once the run closes (M03)
- wake fold relabels a stale spend_budget_decision_ready wake after a promote; delivered
  as is while still in triage (M20)
- TUI poller (_collect_kanban_notifications) delivers the decision notice once (M21)

Proof (hermes-worker-4, scratch HOME, scripts/run_tests.sh):
